    { t: 'The first:', p: 'the excuses, complications, lack of time — they’re there, that’s life and there’s nothing we can do about it. What we can do is train our discipline and be consistent. A great way to start is with 30 minutes — some days it might be more.' },
    { t: 'The second:', p: 'Goals matter. Without goals, you stand at the music stand, you tune, and… now what? What are you going to play? The same as always — you end up feeling like you’re not moving forward.' },
